<title>USA: Trident oks buyback of 250,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Trident oks buyback of 250,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Conn 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trident International Inc said Tuesday that its board had approved the repurchase of 250,000 shares as part of a buyback plan announced in May.</p>
<p>The added approval brings the total number of shares approved for repurchase to 500,000. To date, 245,000 shares have been repurchased, Trident said.</p>
<p>The company said it would use repurchased shares to meet obligations under its employee benefit plans and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
